# Public table mosaic is frozen

The **public mosaic** (every table count, 1 through 20) is **approved as-is**. Do **not** modify it unless the user **explicitly countermands** this rule (e.g. “change the mosaic”, “move the stacks”, “resize the side pots”).

## Protected files and tokens

- `apps/display/src/mosaicSeatStacks.tsx`
- `apps/display/src/mosaicTileLayout.ts` — plaque size, corner dock, seat rail
- `apps/display/src/VenueEightTablesPreview.tsx` — only when the change affects a mosaic felt, seat, stack, folded label, all-in, eligibility chip, pot, or side-pot plaque
- Mosaic classes in `apps/display/src/index.css`:
  - `.vfd-mosaic-seat-face`, `.vfd-mosaic-seat-folded`, `.vfd-mosaic-seat-status`, `.vfd-mosaic-seat-initial`
  - `.vfd-mosaic-seat-stack`, `.vfd-mosaic-stack`, `.vfd-mosaic-dollar`
  - `.vfd-mosaic-side-badge`, `.vfd-mosaic-side-plaque`, `.vfd-mosaic-side-lane`

## Do not change (without explicit user request)

- Where stacks sit, how tight they are, or their type size
- Folded on the felt side of the initials, or All-in in place of the stack
- Eligibility chips at the upper corners of the initials
- Side-pot chip size, including the smaller chips at five and six tables
- Felt, initials, hole cards, community cards, or the table grid
- “Drive-by” refactors that move these styles and alter how a table looks

## Allowed without countermand

- Bug fixes that **only** fix a crash or wrong stack, pot, or seat **data** — **only if** the picture stays identical; mention the exception in the commit message
- The host 1–20 preview strip, as long as the picture it shows does not change

## When the user countermands

Proceed with their specific mosaic instructions only for that turn (or the scope they name). Do not broaden changes beyond what they asked.

## Checklist before merging any display change

- [ ] Did this diff touch protected mosaic files, classes, or the mosaic path in `VenueEightTablesPreview.tsx`? If yes, did the user explicitly request it?
- [ ] If the mosaic was touched without user request, revert those hunks.
